    "aggregate": "Project=max(costAction floor, all project candidates). Four gates independently max per-stage including explicit H09/H10 standalone-cost mappings; do not copy project action. Persist all reasons and flag all equal-max project/stage primaries; sort code/evidenceHash.",
    "manual": "Manual materiality review may resolve unknown qualitative issues to an evidenced classification. It cannot replace automatic/proven normal-attention-risk findings, downgrade source floor/BLOCK, change maturity or supply missing hard facts. Generic exception downgrade excluded pending separate authorized approval/expiry baseline."
  },
  "reviews": {
    "signal": [
      "Require session/CSRF/finance action and source-derived sensitive-write permissions; expectedVersion/sourceHash/evaluationHash/requestKey all mandatory.",
      "Lock project+evaluation, compare every source assertion, CAS OSER WHERE version+active and increment version even child-only review. System generated values stay immutable.",
      "Append unique-active signal review with actor/rationale/source+effective hashes; regenerate all four current bindings/source summaries under effective overlay sameTX. Old binding reviews become historical/stale."
    ],
    "gate": [
      "Lock exact current project/stage/binding; validate source assertions, complete blocking codes and source summary exact target/project/stage/source/evaluation/policy hashes/package/projection/export.",
      "bindingAction is pre-review assertion. acknowledge preserves action; tighten-review/block only increases severity. Decision is server assertion: block=>blocked, incomplete evidence/materiality=>review-required, otherwise confirmed when exact human duties satisfied.",
      "Advice REVIEW may stay REVIEW after confirmed manual review; confirmed means review satisfied, not payout authorization. BLOCK cannot be confirmed away.",
      "CAS binding; append single-active gate review and produce new reviewed summary+projection+payload. Request summarySnapshotId asserted pre-review source summary; response points to new reviewed summary.",
      "Preallocate review ID in immutable summary payload then insert review FK to summary, avoiding FK cycle; never rewrite prior summary payload/projections."
    ],
