      "data": "Authorized field projections and internal immutable payload/hash only; e2e-v1 package never production."
    },
    "idempotency": "scope operation+targetScope+actor+requestKey. Hash validated body+source/evaluation/policy. Exact authenticated same-actor committed replay before stale CAS returns receipt, changed payload conflicts. Receipt/audit sameTX."
  },
